{"strongs": "H3363", "word": "יָקַע", "translit": "ya.qa", "root": "יקע", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "be dislocated, alienated", "definition": "יָקַע verb be dislocated, alienated (Arabic is fall, fall down, fall upon, befal, happen ) — Qal Imperfect 3 feminine singular תֵּקַע Jer 6:8 וַתֵּ֫קַע Gen 32:26 + 2 t.; dislocated Gen 32:26 (Jacob's thigh); elsewhere figurative of נפשׁ ; torn away, alienated from any one, followed by מִן Jer 6:8 ; Ezek 23:17 followed by מֵעַל v Ezek 23:18 . Hiph`il Perfect וְהוֺקַעֲנוּם consecutive 2Sam 21:6 Imperfect וַיֹּקִיעֻם v 2Sam 21:9 Imperative הוֺקַע Num 25:4 of some solemn form of execution, but meaning uncertain: Aq Ges impale ; ᵐ5 ᵑ6 expose ( ἐξηλιάζειν , παραδειγματἰζειν ); ᵑ7 ᵑ9 crucify ; Rs Rel. Semitic 398 (419) throw down (Arabic ) a rock (compare 2Chr 25:12 ): + ליהוה 2Sam 21:6 ( ׳ לפני י v 2Sam 21:9 ), Num 25:4 . Hoph`al Participle הַמּוּקָעִים 2Sam 21:13 passive of Hiph`il", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3696')\">BDB3696</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3363')\">H3363</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3695')\">BDB3695</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3697')\">BDB3697</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יָקַע</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>be dislocated, alienated</highlightword> (Arabic <placeholder2288/> is <highlight>fall, fall down, fall upon, befal, happen</highlight>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>תֵּקַע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 6:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,6,8)\">Jer 6:8</ref> <bdbheb>וַתֵּ֫קַע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 32:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,26)\">Gen 32:26</ref> + 2 t.; <highlight>dislocated</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 32:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,26)\">Gen 32:26</ref> (Jacob's thigh); elsewhere figurativ